                                                "sense_id": "824f77d5-0a36-3051-9e1c-388800c9629e",
                                                "text": "Numerous excursions into the field proved to the author that stone axes were unsuitable for gathering shaftings of the proper diameter for arrows. Chopping resulted in long tapering ends […]"
